</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<div class="card"><h1>Pick Reminder Deadline Fix v002</h1>
<div class="info"><b>Cause:</b> the current deadline value includes <code>ET</code>, while the parser also explicitly supplies <code>America/New_York</code>. PHP treats that as a double timezone specification and rejects it. This update strips the display suffix before parsing, while preserving the displayed ET deadline.</div></div>

<?php if($msg!==''):?><div class="<?php echo $type==='ok'?'ok':'err';?>" style="margin-bottom:14px"><?php echo pfd_h($msg);?><?php if($type==='ok'&&strpos($msg,'INSTALL COMPLETE')!==false):?> &nbsp; <a href="/pick_reminder_dashboard.php">Open Pick Reminder Dashboard</a><?php endif;?></div><?php endif;?>

<div class="card"><h2>Preflight</h2><table><thead><tr><th>CHECK</th><th>STATUS</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach($checks as $label=>$ok):?><tr><td><?php echo pfd_h($label);?></td><td class="<?php echo $ok?'pass':'fail';?>"><?php echo $ok?'PASS':'FAIL';?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?>
</tbody></table></div>

<div class="card"><h2>Apply</h2><p>Updates only the Pick Reminder helper/dashboard. No database changes. No email is sent by this installer.</p>
<form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="apply"><button class="btn <?php echo $ready?'green':'disabled';?>" <?php echo $ready?'':'disabled';?>>Apply Deadline Fix v002</button></form></div>

<div class="card"><h2>Rollback</h2><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="rollback"><button class="btn red">Rollback</button></form></div>
</div></body></html>
